msgid "Non-GPS Position Estimation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:7
#: e1a741682dd14bb0a6e0cc0f6841553d
msgid "This page explains how MAVLink can be used to send in external position and velocity estimates to ArduPilot's EKF allowing it to maintain a position estimate and thus control itself without a GPS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:9
#: 7266c039246242cfa25c38b2547111b4
msgid "This is also called \"External Navigation\" although to be more precise it involves estimation rather than navigation or control."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:13
#: 7f5ddebd489f4a3db98374ec86b681f5
msgid "The user wiki pages for :ref:`Non-GPS navigation is here <copter:common-non-gps-navigation-landing-page>` and :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions is here <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:15
#: 6e4f518c20f449d7a4a62fe3eeb053b2
msgid "Any of the following messages should be sent to the autopilot at 4hz or higher:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:17
#: 02519a5811d74ca8be5f8da490f74af9
msgid "`ODOMETRY <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ODOMETRY>`__ (the preferred method)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:18
#: b8b410a464e1480c9172906d2b66fc46
msgid "`VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE>`__ and optionally `VISION_SPEED_ESTIMATE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VISION_SPEED_ESTIMATE>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:19
#: 11b54696ee2a4c7b86ce0c6808aad82e
msgid "`VISION_POSITION_DELTA <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/ardupilotmega.html#VISION_POSITION_DELTA>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:20
#: ca15a209a1de4dd3b5d4afa78838f9be
msgid "`VICON_POSITION_ESTIMATE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#VICON_POSITION_ESTIMATE>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:21
#: 4a6e9fb6a986408788d6cab5407f3efd
msgid "`ATT_POS_MOCAP <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ATT_POS_MOCAP>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:22
#: e0c5c533c4a645d1adcca442b6360c25
msgid "`GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GLOBAL_VISION_POSITION_ESTIMATE>`__ (not recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:23
#: b7dba17711be41658a16b0e8507bdc62
msgid "`GPS_INPUT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#GPS_INPUT>`__ (not recommended)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:25
#: 6d7f6e4bae7b458fbfec3fd76ed1fd49
msgid "ArduPilot's parameters should be setup as if a :ref:`ModalAI VOXL <copter:common-modalai-voxl>` is used which includes:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:27
#: 2bcb928957164f02b0079e12a7280690
msgid "Set :ref:`VISO_TYPE <VISO_TYPE>` = 3 (VOXL)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:28
#: 9640533ef03143988eb3bfd359f14e50
msgid "Set :ref:`VISO_POS_X <VISO_POS_X>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Y <VISO_POS_Y>`, :ref:`VISO_POS_Z <VISO_POS_Z>` to the camera's position on the vehicle"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:29
#: c1953170283f4d65b0269780b62381dd
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSXY <EK3_SRC1_POSXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:30
#: 7ce95184da2640dd9fb718f06997f56e
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELXY <EK3_SRC1_VELXY>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 0 (None)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:31
#: dc71cfc3a57542c9aa1cf0c2f9ec2f8e
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_POSZ <EK3_SRC1_POSZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 1 (Baro)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:32
#: cac1b18dbd1947a6b2a92418bd7b97d7
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_VELZ <EK3_SRC1_VELZ>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 0 (None)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:33
#: cc9063fd4397479888e079f7c28acadd
msgid "Set :ref:`EK3_SRC1_YAW <EK3_SRC1_YAW>` = 6 (ExternalNav) or 1 (Compass)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:35
#: fd9c8cf3f8b64401b4e25681ebc2edba
msgid "In addition it may be useful to setup :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>` to allow switching between GPS and External Navigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:37
#: 7fc42179023e4b859c681478aeafc838
msgid "If no GPS is attached to the autopilot then the :ref:`EKF origin must be set <mavlink-get-set-home-and-origin>` before the EKF can start estimating its position.  If the vehicle will always be flown at the same location the `ahrs-set-origin.lua script <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_Scripting/applets/ahrs-set-origin.lua>`__ may be used"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:40
#: f210bce54d9a44b39980040dd529ed06
msgid "ODOMETRY message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:42
#: 091fb9ca0c50405790ce4666d910314b
msgid "The preferred method is to send an `ODOMETRY <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#ODOMETRY>`__ with the fields populated as described below:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:149
#: 1ce8104bd0f344e4b3dc26f1d153a896
msgid "Six \"pos_covariance\" array elements are used to calculate the position error and angle error"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:151
#: 773a748b64d343959dcee2e8e3d82699
msgid "0: x-axis position error (m)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:152
#: c311bf52353143d9b1a1ae6311e9abad
msgid "6: y-axis position error (m)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:153
#: b8f42d2a404e4ff9bcf9e8a4c8370581
msgid "11: z-axis position error (m)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:154
#: 6b29442e94304933847a1897b90dbc8c
msgid "15: roll angle error (rad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:155
#: 0b7763f68a1d4ba68d68be955644c68e
msgid "18: pitch angle error (rad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:156
#: a58682f1967249d3a80e06527d8cc3c0
msgid "20: yaw angle error (rad)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:158
#: 424ffcd8b97946ec8a77d1b4d6d62481
msgid "For both position and angle error, the 3 elements are combined to create a single error which is used during EKF sensor fusion"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:163
#: 31c4915a88b047ecb165fb096fd66d6c
msgid "In addition the position error is constrained to be between :ref:`VISO_POS_M_NSE <VISO_POS_M_NSE>` and 100 and the angle error between :ref:`VISO_YAW_M_NSE <VISO_YAW_M_NSE>` and 1.5"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:165
#: 979b526e4f5842afbc52b7771172ac03
msgid "Messages with \"quality\" below the :ref:`VISO_QUAL_MIN <VISO_QUAL_MIN>` parameter value are ignored"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:168
#: c3f7f711144749f3b1736d1c186d47e8
msgid "OPTICAL_FLOW message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:170
#: ab0627bf56a3460d94b6a424a888de86
msgid "An offboard optical flow sensor can send its horizontal flow sensor data to the autopilot using the `OPTICAL_FLOW <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#OPTICAL_FLOW>`__ message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:172
#: ab23a7d7c9e34ce9adc00d36623a6ebe
msgid "Users should set :ref:`FLOW_TYPE<FLOW_TYPE>` = 5 (MAVLink) and then perform the :ref:`Optical Flow Setup procedure <copter:common-optical-flow-sensor-setup>` before use"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:236
#: 81566f560a2d4b0d85922318981a4acb
msgid "Please see this `issue 29131 <https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/issues/29131>`__ for improvements we should make to the handling of this message"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:239
#: 3e0250b93684418ebab94b5cf9f8945e
msgid "GPS/Non-GPS Transitions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:241
#: e4c5aa73f7eb4a4499086f1da9fae434
msgid "The user wiki page for :ref:`GPS/Non-GPS transitions is here <copter:common-non-gps-to-gps>`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-nongps-position-estimation.rst:243
#: d97acf985d844bd8885b8857b0b8fa78
msgid "The EKF's active source set can be changed in real-time by sending a `COMMAND_LONG <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ or `COMMAND_INT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_INT>`__ message with the \"command\" field set to `MAV_CMD_SET_EKF_SOURCE_SET (42007) <https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L144>`__ and \"param1\" set to a number between 1 and 3"
msgstr ""
